{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recruit Workers to start doing your bidding in an attempt to rebuild your Fallen Kingdom!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get your workers to mine gold, chop trees for lumber and build structures for you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965240/extras/2bf3de5fd79f42badbe657e323b5df34.poster.avif?t=1761387343\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965240/extras/2bf3de5fd79f42badbe657e323b5df34.webm?t=1761387343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965240/extras/2bf3de5fd79f42badbe657e323b5df34.mp4?t=1761387343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Go out into the Wilderness and Hunt animals to gain extra Resources!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruiting Units requires you to gather Food.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965240/extras/57ea9102aaf256deeadd4b476ee43379.poster.avif?t=1761387343\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965240/extras/57ea9102aaf256deeadd4b476ee43379.webm?t=1761387343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965240/extras/57ea9102aaf256deeadd4b476ee43379.mp4?t=1761387343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Begin Constructing your new Kingdom!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are currently 6 different buildings to construct. Build these to enhance your Kingdom.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965240/extras/37df8e6aec6422b5263d66c77c61732d.poster.avif?t=1761387343\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965240/extras/37df8e6aec6422b5263d66c77c61732d.webm?t=1761387343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965240/extras/37df8e6aec6422b5263d66c77c61732d.mp4?t=1761387343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend against the Raid Boss's Army of Monsters!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day, waves of enemies may seek to destroy your base it. Protect your humans!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965240/extras/f9382220834e812c7f7495ddd6f72a78.poster.avif?t=1761387343\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965240/extras/f9382220834e812c7f7495ddd6f72a78.webm?t=1761387343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965240/extras/f9382220834e812c7f7495ddd6f72a78.mp4?t=1761387343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recruit Loyal Knights, Archers and Heroes who will help you on your Dangerous Adventures!\u00a0</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control your little army and destroy the goblin outposts to stop the daily invasion, then head out to explore the world.<br><span 